WEBVTT

00:00:13.597 --> 00:00:15.348
[mouse squeaking]

00:00:20.187 --> 00:00:21.730
[girl giggling]

00:00:26.401 --> 00:00:27.945
[girl chuckling]

00:00:29.404 --> 00:00:31.990
[man] What makes you laugh?

00:00:32.074 --> 00:00:34.367
[girl] I'm happy.
You make me happy.

00:00:47.172 --> 00:00:49.925
[man] A little extra for you
this week, Sunflower.

00:01:02.855 --> 00:01:04.272
Come in now.

00:01:10.320 --> 00:01:11.321
[boy] You were long today.

00:01:11.404 --> 00:01:13.574
Go wash your face and hands!

00:01:17.452 --> 00:01:19.412
Give it back!

00:01:23.375 --> 00:01:24.793
How much do we have?

00:01:24.877 --> 00:01:25.878
I'm busy.

00:01:25.961 --> 00:01:27.545
When I'm finished counting,
I will tell you.

00:01:31.925 --> 00:01:33.719
Do we have enough
to go to the festival?

00:01:35.470 --> 00:01:37.305
You're not smart.
You never were.

00:01:37.389 --> 00:01:38.598
Mother and Father said so.

00:01:38.682 --> 00:01:41.601
Don't talk to me like that.
I'm your older brother.

00:01:41.685 --> 00:01:42.686
[girl] In years only.

00:01:42.770 --> 00:01:45.939
If it weren't for my work,
you'd starve to death in the streets.

00:01:46.023 --> 00:01:48.901
All I said was
that I want to go to the festival.

00:01:48.984 --> 00:01:50.611
Play for a little while only.

00:01:50.694 --> 00:01:52.487
And what do we buy food with?

00:01:52.570 --> 00:01:55.407
Look at all these coins.
I'm sure we could spare a few.

00:01:56.324 --> 00:01:59.787
Go, then.
But do not return looking for more.

00:02:05.959 --> 00:02:08.336
Maybe you aren't
as stupid as I thought, Sidao.

00:02:08.420 --> 00:02:10.380
[Jia Sidao] I'm sorry, Mei Lin.

00:02:15.385 --> 00:02:16.929
[Mei Lin sobbing]

00:02:18.681 --> 00:02:20.683
Great Khan, please!

00:02:20.766 --> 00:02:23.977
[Jingim] Lower your eyes
when you speak to the Khan of Khans!

00:02:24.061 --> 00:02:26.396
I never meant to harm you!

00:02:26.479 --> 00:02:27.648
No!

00:02:27.731 --> 00:02:29.692
Only my beloved!

00:02:30.943 --> 00:02:32.861
Who sent you?

00:02:32.945 --> 00:02:35.072
[Mei Lin] Chancellor Jia Sidao.

00:02:35.155 --> 00:02:36.782
[Kublai] He instructed you
to kill the Empress?

00:02:36.865 --> 00:02:40.661
[Mei Lin] At first, I was to gather
knowledge of your court.

00:02:40.744 --> 00:02:43.496
But he sent an emissary
the night of the White Moon

00:02:43.580 --> 00:02:44.707
with new orders.

00:02:44.790 --> 00:02:46.667
Why the Empress,
not the Khan?

00:02:49.544 --> 00:02:51.504
Who knows my brother's mind?

00:02:53.298 --> 00:02:55.050
Brother?

00:02:56.719 --> 00:02:58.303
[Chabi] Who is the emissary
you speak of?

00:02:58.386 --> 00:03:01.431
A concubine within the court.
A friend.

00:03:01.514 --> 00:03:05.018
Does she lay in wait in Cambulac,
to strike as you did?

00:03:05.102 --> 00:03:06.770
[Mei Lin] No, she fled.

00:03:06.854 --> 00:03:09.982
As soon as she arrives in Xiangyang
with news of my failure,

00:03:10.065 --> 00:03:12.400
Jia Sidao will kill my daughter!

00:03:13.861 --> 00:03:18.365
I did this, all of this,
to save my little girl!

00:03:18.448 --> 00:03:21.744
Empress, you have given birth.

00:03:21.827 --> 00:03:23.661
You know the bond
between mother and child!

00:03:23.746 --> 00:03:25.580
What would you not do
to protect them?

00:03:27.624 --> 00:03:30.543
-[whimpering] Please, no.
-Whore.

00:03:30.627 --> 00:03:36.008
How dare you
speak to me of love?

00:03:37.425 --> 00:03:41.471
I know the Walled City.
I know the Song court.

00:03:41.554 --> 00:03:43.348
My words can save
so many lives.

00:03:43.431 --> 00:03:45.392
All I ask

00:03:45.475 --> 00:03:47.811
is that you save one.

00:03:54.735 --> 00:03:56.278
Remove her.

00:04:01.241 --> 00:04:03.243
[theme music playing]

00:05:37.087 --> 00:05:39.256
[Chabi] The concubine was a tool.

00:05:39.339 --> 00:05:42.300
Like a sword, she has no say
into whose body she is thrust.

00:05:42.384 --> 00:05:44.011
You wanted her head yourself.

00:05:44.094 --> 00:05:47.430
Don't weaken your resolve now, wife.
I will not weaken mine.

00:05:47.514 --> 00:05:51.726
What I wanted in a weaker moment,
husband, I resisted.

00:05:51.809 --> 00:05:55.063
I ask you do the same.

00:05:55.147 --> 00:05:56.481
Allow her life.

00:05:56.564 --> 00:06:00.485
To have Buddha on our side
is a great ally, I know this.

00:06:00.568 --> 00:06:02.070
But as the Bible says,

00:06:02.154 --> 00:06:04.739
"An eye for an eye,
a tooth for a tooth."

00:06:04.822 --> 00:06:05.908
Kublai,

00:06:05.991 --> 00:06:09.119
you quote whatever holiness
suits you at the time.

00:06:09.202 --> 00:06:11.663
Are there no shallows
in the lake of your compassion?

00:06:11.746 --> 00:06:13.999
Just because she is a mother
who weeps for her child?

00:06:14.082 --> 00:06:17.460
Because she is the sister
of our greatest enemy!

00:06:17.544 --> 00:06:19.004
[grunts]

00:06:19.087 --> 00:06:22.007
And an agent of the Song court.

00:06:23.841 --> 00:06:27.512
If you spare her...
you may use her.

00:06:35.562 --> 00:06:37.105
Fine.

00:06:37.189 --> 00:06:38.315
If the bitch lives,

00:06:38.398 --> 00:06:42.485
she lives with the knowledge that
everyone she knew has died by my sword.

00:06:43.153 --> 00:06:46.489
If you attack Xiangyang,
thousands will perish.

00:06:46.573 --> 00:06:48.116
Tens of thousands.

00:06:48.200 --> 00:06:50.077
[Chabi] I will not bathe in that blood.

00:06:50.160 --> 00:06:52.620
I will not have war in my name.

00:06:52.704 --> 00:06:54.456
I deserve revenge.

00:06:54.539 --> 00:06:57.542
As do I, my love.

00:06:57.625 --> 00:07:01.964
But do not use a battering ram
when an arrow will do.

00:07:09.346 --> 00:07:12.265
Let your vengeance fly exactly, Kublai.

00:07:12.349 --> 00:07:14.809
There is a better way.

00:07:22.025 --> 00:07:23.026
[gasps]

00:07:23.110 --> 00:07:24.111
[panting]

00:07:24.194 --> 00:07:26.154
[Ahmad] You need not fear.

00:07:26.238 --> 00:07:27.530
Shh.

00:07:28.865 --> 00:07:32.369
If we wanted you dead...
you wouldn't have awoken.

00:07:36.999 --> 00:07:39.084
I've heard the songs
they sing about you.

00:07:40.085 --> 00:07:44.172
How your brother crawled up
and into the Imperial Court

00:07:44.256 --> 00:07:46.799
through the wet spot in your bed.

00:07:49.094 --> 00:07:51.013
Whose prisoner am I?

00:07:51.096 --> 00:07:53.265
You are the prisoner
of the Grand Khan.

00:07:54.474 --> 00:07:57.227
Then why am I
in your quarters?

00:07:58.353 --> 00:08:01.189
All currency
is my jurisdiction.

00:08:02.607 --> 00:08:05.193
And whores are bought and sold.

00:08:05.277 --> 00:08:06.319
[groans]

00:08:07.945 --> 00:08:09.906
Why does your brother
want Empress Chabi dead?

00:08:09.990 --> 00:08:13.994
To defeat Kublai
in the shadow of the Walled City

00:08:14.077 --> 00:08:18.456
would win Sidao great fame
and save the Song dynasty.

00:08:18.540 --> 00:08:22.919
If the Khan leaves these gates,
he brings the wrath of Genghis.

00:08:24.337 --> 00:08:26.256
Has your brother no wisdom?

00:08:26.339 --> 00:08:28.050
Some men have mastered wisdom,

00:08:29.134 --> 00:08:31.053
some devilry.

00:08:31.136 --> 00:08:35.723
Does Sidao hide devilry
behind the walls of Xiangyang?

00:08:39.102 --> 00:08:40.728
Of course.

00:08:40.812 --> 00:08:43.523
If you knew
and surrendered that information,

00:08:43.606 --> 00:08:45.692
you'd be out of currency, wouldn't you?

00:08:48.486 --> 00:08:49.612
[Mei Lin] Why do this?

00:08:50.655 --> 00:08:53.033
Pretend to care.

00:08:56.661 --> 00:08:57.954
You will heal.

00:08:58.996 --> 00:09:00.457
Fully, I expect.

00:09:06.379 --> 00:09:07.672
[croaking]

00:09:07.755 --> 00:09:09.299
[Ling Ling] I want to see!

00:09:12.177 --> 00:09:13.553
[giggling]

00:09:14.929 --> 00:09:16.223
Ling!

00:09:25.857 --> 00:09:27.400
[Ling Ling] I missed you.

00:09:27.484 --> 00:09:29.652
I've missed you, too,
sweet one.

00:09:29.736 --> 00:09:33.073
I must speak to the Empress.
We will play later, yes?

00:09:41.581 --> 00:09:44.417
[Empress Dowager]
Something pains you, my child.

00:09:44.501 --> 00:09:47.587
[Jing Fei] What I'm about to confess
could lose me my head.

00:09:47.670 --> 00:09:50.173
[Empress Dowager] Are you certain
I am an appropriate confessor?

00:09:50.257 --> 00:09:53.843
[Jing Fei] I can only hope...
for I have nowhere else to turn.

00:09:59.474 --> 00:10:01.934
I have lied to the Chancellor.

00:10:05.813 --> 00:10:08.150
[Empress Dowager]
A word of truth lasts forever.

00:10:09.359 --> 00:10:12.362
A lie lasts only a moment, my child.

00:10:12.445 --> 00:10:15.407
Jia Sidao sent me to Cambulac

00:10:15.490 --> 00:10:18.868
to find Mei Lin and charge her
to assassinate the Mongol queen.

00:10:18.951 --> 00:10:20.703
Lady Chabi is dead?

00:10:20.787 --> 00:10:22.079
No, Empress.

00:10:22.164 --> 00:10:23.706
Mei Lin failed.

00:10:24.707 --> 00:10:26.626
But I reported otherwise.

00:10:27.627 --> 00:10:31.214
It's only a matter of time before
the Chancellor discovers my deceit.

00:10:32.340 --> 00:10:34.551
I have signed my own decree of death.

00:10:35.677 --> 00:10:37.595
And Ling's too, I fear.

00:10:45.019 --> 00:10:47.855
Then a lie must last one day longer.

00:10:49.149 --> 00:10:52.777
When the sun sets tomorrow,
so will Sidao's service.

00:10:52.860 --> 00:10:54.237
He's done.

00:10:55.572 --> 00:10:56.989
And Ling?

00:10:57.073 --> 00:10:59.075
[Empress Dowager]
We all must bide our time.

00:10:59.159 --> 00:11:02.745
Keep her from the Chancellor
until after the coronation.

00:11:04.956 --> 00:11:10.253
Be strong, young one,
for your charge and for your future.

00:11:11.171 --> 00:11:12.339
[Ling Ling laughing]

00:11:17.510 --> 00:11:20.305
You are a Taoist monk.

00:11:20.388 --> 00:11:24.684
Permitted to eat meat, drink wine,
enjoy a woman.

00:11:24.767 --> 00:11:25.977
Yet...

00:11:26.060 --> 00:11:28.104
you have never taken a wife.

00:11:29.356 --> 00:11:33.192
I devoted my life to the service
of the Great Khan and his empire.

00:11:33.276 --> 00:11:36.779
I only have so much time
on this earth.

00:11:36.863 --> 00:11:41.033
I have never taken a wife because
I do my best to avoid disappointment.

00:11:41.117 --> 00:11:42.244
[Kublai] Hmm.

00:11:43.578 --> 00:11:46.498
My second wife,
she has a golden tongue.

00:11:47.665 --> 00:11:50.001
You are blessed, Lord Kublai.

00:11:51.253 --> 00:11:55.131
I give her gold to keep it
in the abyss she calls a mouth.

00:11:55.965 --> 00:11:57.008
My third wife...

00:11:58.050 --> 00:12:02.680
she has small and wrinkled teats,
like the dried fruit on a fig tree.

00:12:04.181 --> 00:12:05.767
But Chabi...

00:12:07.143 --> 00:12:11.188
she is an irreproachable gift
from the Eternal Blue Sky.

00:12:13.149 --> 00:12:15.818
Had someone taken her from me...

00:12:22.492 --> 00:12:27.455
You will go to Xiangyang
and kill Chancellor Jia Sidao.

00:12:32.209 --> 00:12:35.630
Some may question
the wisdom of sending a blind monk

00:12:35.713 --> 00:12:37.965
to assassinate the prime minister.

00:12:38.049 --> 00:12:42.094
A blind monk who
once killed 25 of my best soldiers.

00:12:43.971 --> 00:12:48.935
A Wudang warrior said to be
able to pass through walls unseen.

00:12:49.018 --> 00:12:51.228
Suddenly, you are lame?

00:12:54.607 --> 00:12:57.610
And should I pass through
the open gates of Cambulac,

00:12:57.694 --> 00:12:59.612
what makes you think
I will ever return?

00:12:59.696 --> 00:13:02.114
What makes you think
I want you to?

00:13:04.326 --> 00:13:08.037
The Latin,
is he accomplished?

00:13:08.120 --> 00:13:10.540
For someone who has
no accomplishments.

00:13:10.623 --> 00:13:12.083
Good.

00:13:12.166 --> 00:13:14.251
He will be your eyes and escort.

00:13:15.628 --> 00:13:17.505
[Hundred Eyes] You do not listen, do you?

00:13:17.589 --> 00:13:19.924
[Kublai] Oh, I do listen.

00:13:20.007 --> 00:13:22.259
Then I hear what I want to.

00:13:23.803 --> 00:13:26.055
Princess.

00:13:26.138 --> 00:13:29.392
Empress Chabi has summoned you to court.

00:13:29.476 --> 00:13:33.020
Has she summoned
all the women of the Hall of Fragrance?

00:13:36.107 --> 00:13:37.567
Only you.

00:13:38.735 --> 00:13:41.654
She has never invited me
for a private audience.

00:13:41.738 --> 00:13:42.905
Be calm.

00:13:42.989 --> 00:13:45.157
Lady Chabi knows nothing of your past.

00:13:45.241 --> 00:13:47.994
You are the Blue Princess of Bayaut.

00:13:48.077 --> 00:13:49.704
-No one will challenge this.
-[sighs]

00:13:49.787 --> 00:13:51.789
I challenge it.

00:13:55.292 --> 00:13:56.461
[sighs]

00:14:00.590 --> 00:14:03.134
Worry not, Princess.

00:14:05.595 --> 00:14:07.930
I will make you regal.

00:14:15.730 --> 00:14:17.023
[Kublai] Ah!

00:14:18.232 --> 00:14:21.318
What is the reach of
the highest wall in Italy?

00:14:21.403 --> 00:14:26.491
The upper church of
the Basilica Papale di San Francesco.

00:14:26.574 --> 00:14:27.909
It stands five stories.

00:14:27.992 --> 00:14:31.203
To bring your people
that much closer to your God?

00:14:32.372 --> 00:14:33.831
Or further from our demons.

00:14:33.915 --> 00:14:35.708
[Kublai laughs]

00:14:35.792 --> 00:14:39.045
Now, imagine a wall stretching
far closer to the sky.

00:14:39.796 --> 00:14:41.172
Xiangyang.

00:14:41.255 --> 00:14:44.341
I present to you the gerege.

00:14:44.426 --> 00:14:48.430
With this golden tablet,
gates will open before you

00:14:48.513 --> 00:14:50.515
as you ride to the south.

00:14:53.851 --> 00:14:57.271
You will infiltrate the Song fortress.

00:14:57.354 --> 00:14:59.315
While Hundred Eyes
attends to his task,

00:14:59.399 --> 00:15:02.777
you will gather information
as to the defenses of the rebels.

00:15:04.404 --> 00:15:07.364
May I inquire as to
Hundred Eyes' task?

00:15:07.449 --> 00:15:09.992
He will kill Chancellor Jia Sidao.

00:15:11.077 --> 00:15:13.830
[Ahmad] Sidao's sister has
an ally within the walls.

00:15:13.913 --> 00:15:17.249
Another whore
by the name of Jing Fei.

00:15:17.333 --> 00:15:20.127
She also utilized a treacherous
stable-boy from our slums

00:15:20.211 --> 00:15:21.879
to send messages to Xiangyang.

00:15:21.963 --> 00:15:23.756
That is all we have learned
at this time.

00:15:23.840 --> 00:15:26.133
The Song coronation draws near.

00:15:27.134 --> 00:15:32.014
In that moment, the Empress Dowager
will preside over a shift in power.

00:15:32.098 --> 00:15:35.602
Sidao seeks to secure war
before that happens.

00:15:35.685 --> 00:15:38.020
Securing war secures his power.

00:15:38.104 --> 00:15:40.189
His death averts it.

00:15:41.941 --> 00:15:44.527
Ride swiftly, Master Marco.

00:15:57.582 --> 00:16:00.918
Mei Lin has a message
she would like delivered to Jing Fei.

00:16:02.712 --> 00:16:05.548
I do not know
these names you speak.

00:16:28.738 --> 00:16:33.284
[Jia Sidao] Your family, their village,
is it far from here?

00:16:33.367 --> 00:16:34.494
No, Chancellor.

00:16:35.787 --> 00:16:39.123
You do not need to
call me that, brightness.

00:16:39.206 --> 00:16:40.667
Not anymore.

00:16:42.084 --> 00:16:44.587
What would you
have me call you?

00:16:46.673 --> 00:16:48.007
What do you like?

00:16:48.966 --> 00:16:51.218
You are my Chancellor.

00:16:55.389 --> 00:16:56.808
Which village is it?

00:16:56.891 --> 00:16:57.892
Luzhi.

00:16:57.975 --> 00:16:59.018
I do not know it.

00:16:59.101 --> 00:17:01.478
It is quite insignificant.

00:17:01.563 --> 00:17:02.689
Impossible.

00:17:02.772 --> 00:17:05.149
It produced you.

00:17:07.359 --> 00:17:08.570
Do you see them?

00:17:08.653 --> 00:17:10.321
Your parents?

00:17:12.073 --> 00:17:13.616
Why?

00:17:15.952 --> 00:17:17.995
They do not approve of me.

00:17:20.039 --> 00:17:21.791
They are ashamed.

00:17:27.088 --> 00:17:29.048
There are so many rules.

00:17:31.425 --> 00:17:34.011
It is the rules
that build the walls.

00:17:36.973 --> 00:17:38.600
To keep us apart.

00:17:42.770 --> 00:17:46.691
And no matter how we wish
to break those walls down...

00:17:48.776 --> 00:17:50.695
the rules allow no margin.

00:17:53.698 --> 00:17:55.241
So there we are,

00:17:55.324 --> 00:17:57.785
resting our hands
on either side of the divide.

00:18:01.038 --> 00:18:04.041
No matter the side,
we are just people.

00:18:06.293 --> 00:18:08.087
That's why I did what I did.

00:18:09.255 --> 00:18:11.048
For you people.

00:18:14.886 --> 00:18:17.179
Do you believe that to be true?

00:18:18.305 --> 00:18:21.976
I believe your heart and your mind
are true to one another.

00:18:26.188 --> 00:18:27.356
In this moment...

00:18:28.983 --> 00:18:30.902
you are most significant to me.

00:18:42.914 --> 00:18:46.333
Do you wish to take me,
my Chancellor?

00:18:49.461 --> 00:18:52.298
[young Mei Lin giggling]

00:18:53.590 --> 00:18:55.426
I-- I need you to tell me.

00:18:56.928 --> 00:18:58.805
Tell me once again.

00:19:02.266 --> 00:19:05.728
The Khan's wife is dead.

00:19:07.063 --> 00:19:11.108
Mei Lin announced her cause
and you her master

00:19:11.192 --> 00:19:13.485
as she slew the Empress.

00:19:16.739 --> 00:19:20.201
Do you wish to take me?

00:19:26.082 --> 00:19:29.043
I wish to pay a visit
to your parents' house...

00:19:30.044 --> 00:19:32.546
to try to correct
their way of thinking.

00:20:05.121 --> 00:20:06.914
[greeting indistinctly]

00:20:20.552 --> 00:20:23.139
This is Ba-Tu.
Care for him well.

00:20:23.222 --> 00:20:26.058
Until my return.

00:20:26.142 --> 00:20:27.810
[Hundred Eyes]
We've got to keep moving.

00:20:31.647 --> 00:20:32.648
[urging horse]

00:20:34.358 --> 00:20:37.987
[Byamba] The scum have
attacked our father,

00:20:38.070 --> 00:20:39.696
the Lord Khan!

00:20:39.781 --> 00:20:42.950
The vermin have
attacked the Empress!

00:20:43.034 --> 00:20:45.244
The Song have vowed to destroy

00:20:45.327 --> 00:20:48.122
everything that
we prize and hold dear!

00:20:49.165 --> 00:20:52.043
Do the sons of Genghis
accept this quietly?

00:20:52.126 --> 00:20:55.379
-[all] No! No!
-Good!

00:20:55.462 --> 00:20:58.549
My men and the men
who follow Princess Khutulun

00:20:58.632 --> 00:21:02.344
become one force
with one purpose!

00:21:02.428 --> 00:21:05.765
To teach the Song devils
that we are Mongols

00:21:05.848 --> 00:21:07.391
and the world is ours!

00:21:07.474 --> 00:21:09.226
[all shouting]

00:21:09.310 --> 00:21:10.812
Why should we
follow the Princess?

00:21:11.854 --> 00:21:13.940
I understand your apprehension.

00:21:14.023 --> 00:21:16.650
What does a girl know of battle?

00:21:16.733 --> 00:21:20.737
What of your great-grandmothers
who rode into war with Genghis Khan?

00:21:20.822 --> 00:21:24.909
To erase your doubts
and ease your fears,

00:21:24.992 --> 00:21:27.536
I will wrestle the best of you.

00:21:27.619 --> 00:21:28.704
[man] Byamba!

00:21:28.788 --> 00:21:33.334
[all chanting] Byamba! Byamba! Byamba!

00:21:33.417 --> 00:21:35.711
Byamba! Byamba!

00:21:35.795 --> 00:21:40.883
Byamba! Byamba! Byamba!

00:21:40.967 --> 00:21:42.969
[all cheering]

00:21:50.810 --> 00:21:53.270
[horn blowing]

00:21:58.067 --> 00:21:59.485
[crowd] Ohh!

00:22:12.248 --> 00:22:13.582
[crowd] Ohh!

00:22:14.458 --> 00:22:15.459
[yells]

00:22:25.386 --> 00:22:26.428
[Khutulun grunts]

00:22:26.512 --> 00:22:28.472
You're not the butterfly I expected.

00:22:28.555 --> 00:22:30.807
And you are not the lioness!

00:22:37.356 --> 00:22:39.441
[panting]

00:22:52.371 --> 00:22:53.789
[all cheering]

00:23:06.635 --> 00:23:09.305
[Chabi] Is the Hall of Fragrance
suitable to your comfort?

00:23:10.639 --> 00:23:14.351
[Kokachin] Yes, it is most pleasing.

00:23:14.435 --> 00:23:17.939
Tell me about the palace
in which you were raised.

00:23:18.022 --> 00:23:21.067
It pales beside
the palace of the Lord Khan.

00:23:21.150 --> 00:23:22.359
You miss it?

00:23:22.443 --> 00:23:27.073
I miss the fresh blue lake...
and my friend, Nergüi.

00:23:27.156 --> 00:23:28.865
What became of her?

00:23:28.950 --> 00:23:30.993
She died.

00:23:31.077 --> 00:23:33.120
During the siege?

00:23:33.204 --> 00:23:34.496
Yes.

00:23:34.580 --> 00:23:39.251
It must be difficult living amongst
those who massacred your people.

00:23:40.544 --> 00:23:43.714
My people had
the opportunity to surrender.

00:23:43.797 --> 00:23:45.967
They chose to fight.

00:23:49.803 --> 00:23:52.764
You have friends here
in Cambulac?

00:23:52.848 --> 00:23:55.309
My eunuch cares for me well.

00:23:56.518 --> 00:23:59.521
What of your sisters
in the Hall of Fragrance?

00:24:02.358 --> 00:24:06.737
They have little understanding
of the people or of the land.

00:24:06.820 --> 00:24:08.364
You find them unworthy?

00:24:09.656 --> 00:24:11.242
They're worthy in their ways

00:24:11.325 --> 00:24:14.286
but know not
of the horse and bow.

00:24:15.037 --> 00:24:17.206
Life's truest pleasures.

00:24:19.416 --> 00:24:23.045
My days of riding unfettered
have long since passed.

00:24:24.463 --> 00:24:27.174
We were raised
in very similar fashion.

00:24:27.258 --> 00:24:30.719
Perhaps we might ride
together one day, Empress.

00:24:30.802 --> 00:24:32.304
Tell me, Princess...

00:24:33.514 --> 00:24:36.058
how do you see your future?

00:24:36.142 --> 00:24:37.268
My Lady?

00:24:37.351 --> 00:24:41.022
You know that you will not inhabit
the Hall of Fragrance forever.

00:24:42.148 --> 00:24:44.566
I never really think about it.

00:24:44.650 --> 00:24:46.693
You may open your heart to me.

00:24:46.777 --> 00:24:49.738
I was once your age.

00:24:49.821 --> 00:24:53.159
I know the dreams
that cloud a royal virgin's head.

00:24:55.161 --> 00:24:56.953
I may have wondered.

00:24:57.038 --> 00:24:59.498
Who is the lucky man
of your thoughts?

00:25:00.499 --> 00:25:03.627
Is he a prince? A king?

00:25:03.710 --> 00:25:04.920
[chuckles]

00:25:05.003 --> 00:25:08.299
Power and prestige are the concern
of the other girls, Lady Chabi.

00:25:08.382 --> 00:25:11.843
Surely, when you
close your eyes at night,

00:25:11.927 --> 00:25:14.430
you pray for a man
of noble character.

00:25:14.513 --> 00:25:19.643
To give my future husband many sons,
that is all I pray for.

00:25:21.937 --> 00:25:24.690
We shall talk much, Princess.

00:25:28.860 --> 00:25:31.905
[Jingim] My father sent Polo
to assassinate our enemy.

00:25:31.988 --> 00:25:33.240
Why can I not understand this?

00:25:33.324 --> 00:25:36.285
-Please, explain this to me.
-[Ahmad] Your father has his reasons.

00:25:36.368 --> 00:25:38.537
[Jingim] I have this
terrible recurring thought.

00:25:39.496 --> 00:25:42.374
Perhaps the wrong brother fell bloody
in the dirt all those months ago.

00:25:42.458 --> 00:25:45.127
Do not repeat those words aloud,
my Prince.

00:25:45.211 --> 00:25:46.503
I will forget them myself.

00:25:46.587 --> 00:25:50.382
Make no mistake, Ahmad,
I love my father, I revered him.

00:25:50.466 --> 00:25:51.800
"Revered"?

00:25:52.968 --> 00:25:56.222
The kingdom has turned its eyes away
as it relates to my father's pets.

00:25:56.305 --> 00:25:58.140
But no other has risen so quickly

00:25:58.224 --> 00:26:01.560
or closely to his side
than the Latin.

00:26:01.643 --> 00:26:04.896
"Open the gates to outsiders
and secrets will spill."

00:26:04.980 --> 00:26:08.192
My uncle said those words to me
when I traveled to Karakorum.

00:26:08.900 --> 00:26:11.528
He may not have been referring
specifically to the round-eyed rat,

00:26:11.612 --> 00:26:12.946
but he could sense it.

00:26:13.029 --> 00:26:16.450
My advice?
Let us see what transpires.

00:26:16.533 --> 00:26:18.827
If Jia Sidao falls
and the wall with him,

00:26:18.910 --> 00:26:20.496
then the boy is beyond reproach.

00:26:20.579 --> 00:26:22.789
Your father's plan
would have succeeded.

00:26:22.873 --> 00:26:24.291
But if he fails

00:26:24.375 --> 00:26:28.044
and if the Khan is not motivated to
push the boy aside by his own hand,

00:26:28.129 --> 00:26:31.089
then we will guide it for him.

00:26:39.181 --> 00:26:42.476
[Jia Sidao] The death of Empress Chabi
puts us in a position of power.

00:26:42.559 --> 00:26:45.854
It was the act of a coward
and a scoundrel.

00:26:45.937 --> 00:26:47.814
What lives will our people have

00:26:47.898 --> 00:26:50.442
when they're enslaved
by the Mongol hordes?

00:26:52.319 --> 00:26:54.280
I so tire of this conversation.

00:26:54.363 --> 00:26:56.740
The coronation is upon us.

00:26:56.823 --> 00:26:59.201
You will be filled with vigor soon enough.

00:26:59.285 --> 00:27:00.494
And in the end,

00:27:00.577 --> 00:27:03.580
you may have achieved
what you set out to.

00:27:03.664 --> 00:27:05.624
Our position at
the negotiating table

00:27:05.707 --> 00:27:08.669
has been weakened by
your foolish play against the Khan.

00:27:08.752 --> 00:27:11.046
And this is why I suggest,
once more,

00:27:11.129 --> 00:27:14.425
that we postpone the transfer of power
until certainty dawns.

00:27:14.508 --> 00:27:15.634
No.

00:27:21.598 --> 00:27:23.309
Did your sister fall?

00:27:23.392 --> 00:27:25.769
One can only assume.

00:27:27.145 --> 00:27:29.731
Is there no hole in your heart?

00:27:29.815 --> 00:27:31.900
Do you not fear
the admission to a daughter

00:27:31.983 --> 00:27:34.903
who must face a life
without a mother?

00:27:36.071 --> 00:27:37.781
Life will continue.

00:27:37.864 --> 00:27:39.575
[inhales deeply]

00:27:39.658 --> 00:27:41.410
And I hope,
as her memory fades,

00:27:41.493 --> 00:27:44.205
Ling will only remember
Mei Lin for what she was...

00:27:45.206 --> 00:27:46.748
a whore.

00:27:48.584 --> 00:27:51.212
After you've packed your porcelain,

00:27:51.295 --> 00:27:53.755
we will clean up the shambles
you've left behind.

00:27:53.839 --> 00:27:56.091
What choice do I have?

00:27:56.174 --> 00:28:00.053
You have succeeded
in your mission, Empress.

00:28:00.136 --> 00:28:02.598
May I remain
after the ink has dried?

00:28:03.640 --> 00:28:07.853
To bear witness the outcome
of your bargains with the devil.

00:28:07.936 --> 00:28:10.564
You are a free man, Jia Sidao.

00:28:10.647 --> 00:28:15.319
Free from responsibility,
free from blame,

00:28:15.402 --> 00:28:18.322
free to stake your claim
wherever you see fit.

00:28:19.323 --> 00:28:22.659
Outside the palace.

00:28:22.743 --> 00:28:25.746
You will always be
a citizen of the Song.

00:28:27.498 --> 00:28:29.416
If only that were true.

00:28:40.219 --> 00:28:42.846
It is as if the gates of hell
have opened.

00:28:42.929 --> 00:28:45.391
It is the warm embrace of home.

00:28:46.892 --> 00:28:48.935
When did you last feel it?

00:28:50.186 --> 00:28:52.606
Be mindful of our mission, Master Polo.

00:28:52.689 --> 00:28:54.483
It is a hard thing we do.

00:28:55.442 --> 00:28:58.320
A hard thing you do, Sifu.

00:29:00.071 --> 00:29:02.616
I draw pictures
while you draw blood.

00:29:02.699 --> 00:29:05.994
The Khan makes considerations
for my failure

00:29:06.077 --> 00:29:07.621
and entrusts you with them.

00:29:08.204 --> 00:29:10.457
That is no small thing.

00:29:16.422 --> 00:29:18.048
This may not end well.

00:29:18.131 --> 00:29:20.133
You continue on, however.

00:29:21.760 --> 00:29:25.306
One death
weighed against a massacre.

00:29:25.389 --> 00:29:28.350
And should we fail,
we fail for a true cause.

00:29:28.434 --> 00:29:31.186
[laughs]

00:29:31.270 --> 00:29:33.397
Did I say something
to amuse you?

00:29:34.606 --> 00:29:38.234
[Hundred Eyes] I fear your mind
has followed your body into bondage.

00:29:40.028 --> 00:29:42.155
You do not believe in the cause?

00:29:43.449 --> 00:29:47.369
What one chooses to believe in
and what one is compelled to believe in,

00:29:47.453 --> 00:29:49.455
there is a difference.

00:30:09.308 --> 00:30:10.934
Don't stop.

00:31:08.158 --> 00:31:09.785
Stop!

00:31:12.913 --> 00:31:14.581
What is your purpose here?

00:31:15.582 --> 00:31:17.668
Open up, show me!

00:31:19.545 --> 00:31:22.088
-Get away! Move! Go.
-Hey!

00:31:22.172 --> 00:31:23.757
You want to see?

00:31:23.840 --> 00:31:25.175
Here.

00:31:26.552 --> 00:31:27.928
In honor of the Emperor.

00:31:28.011 --> 00:31:30.597
You wish to confiscate
the food of His Holiness?

00:31:49.950 --> 00:31:51.117
Where is she?

00:31:51.201 --> 00:31:53.369
She is favored by the Chancellor.

00:31:53.454 --> 00:31:55.581
I will not bring her round
in the light of day.

00:31:55.664 --> 00:31:57.749
If I sense you've raised an alarm,

00:31:57.833 --> 00:32:00.461
I will find you before
my days are done.

00:32:00.544 --> 00:32:02.212
Do you believe me?

00:32:03.547 --> 00:32:06.132
I could have left you
at the gate, monk.

00:32:06.925 --> 00:32:10.721
Once I finish,
I will no longer be at your service...

00:32:10.804 --> 00:32:11.805
yes?

00:32:12.973 --> 00:32:14.015
Mmm.

00:32:14.558 --> 00:32:17.769
Meet me here
when the moon is low.

00:32:40.125 --> 00:32:42.961
[Chabi] My son,
home from the hunt.

00:32:43.962 --> 00:32:46.297
I see your new hawk proves well.

00:32:46.381 --> 00:32:48.884
A fruitful and welcome diversion.

00:32:50.260 --> 00:32:51.970
Were you on the grasslands?

00:32:52.053 --> 00:32:54.014
Your mother is a lovely rider.

00:32:54.097 --> 00:32:56.808
I can only assume
the Princess is as well.

00:32:56.892 --> 00:33:01.146
It was difficult to discern through
all the dust kicked in my face.

00:33:03.482 --> 00:33:06.192
He stands several hands higher
than a Mongol pony.

00:33:06.276 --> 00:33:09.780
Mongolian crossed
with warmer blood.

00:33:09.863 --> 00:33:11.740
-Quite handsome.
-Isn't he?

00:33:13.241 --> 00:33:15.201
-[Jingim] Mother.
-[Kokachin chuckles]

00:33:15.285 --> 00:33:16.703
Do I embarrass you?

00:33:17.746 --> 00:33:19.581
[Sorga] He is quite handsome.

00:33:19.665 --> 00:33:20.791
My daughter.

00:33:20.874 --> 00:33:22.333
Princess.

00:33:23.459 --> 00:33:25.128
Shall we continue?

00:33:43.897 --> 00:33:47.108
[Byamba] Are you planning on whittling her
down to a skewer for the open fire?

00:33:47.192 --> 00:33:49.027
I think you're ready.

00:33:50.361 --> 00:33:51.613
I'm more than ready.

00:33:52.614 --> 00:33:54.490
War is easy.

00:33:54.575 --> 00:33:56.076
The waiting will kill you.

00:33:58.954 --> 00:34:01.247
How do you call your shiny friend?

00:34:02.791 --> 00:34:04.626
Decisive.

00:34:04.710 --> 00:34:07.420
That's a beneficial trait
for the one who wields her.

00:34:07.503 --> 00:34:10.465
As well as for the one
about to receive its sharpened end.

00:34:13.051 --> 00:34:15.345
Do you wish to talk about it?

00:34:15.428 --> 00:34:17.472
What is there to talk about?

00:34:17.556 --> 00:34:20.559
Was it merely theater in front of
the troops the other day?

00:34:20.642 --> 00:34:22.018
[Khutulun scoffs]

00:34:22.102 --> 00:34:23.854
You beat me.
Why do you doubt?

00:34:23.937 --> 00:34:26.982
I have seen you defeat far more
proficient wrestlers than me.

00:34:27.065 --> 00:34:28.274
I do not have the skills--

00:34:28.358 --> 00:34:30.569
Or the balls to marry me.

00:34:30.652 --> 00:34:32.821
So it was a ploy.

00:34:33.989 --> 00:34:37.450
You lost by design in order
to secure my hand in marriage.

00:34:37.533 --> 00:34:40.453
You think much of yourself, Byamba.

00:34:40.536 --> 00:34:43.999
If I wanted you,
I would have had you years ago.

00:34:45.250 --> 00:34:49.254
But for now,
I am engaged to Decisive.

00:34:52.132 --> 00:34:54.718
I would never sever you
from your blade.

00:34:55.719 --> 00:34:58.054
You needn't sacrifice
one for the other.

00:34:58.138 --> 00:35:00.098
The other?

00:35:01.349 --> 00:35:03.268
We are warriors.

00:35:04.603 --> 00:35:06.479
Yes.

00:35:06.562 --> 00:35:08.649
Battle me.

00:35:23.997 --> 00:35:24.998
[screaming]

00:35:27.918 --> 00:35:30.128
I've done my part.
As promised.

00:35:30.211 --> 00:35:32.588
You said I would be
released from my service.

00:35:32.673 --> 00:35:33.757
You are.

00:35:41.807 --> 00:35:44.768
-[Jing Fei screaming]
-[Marco] Stop it! Stop!

00:35:44.851 --> 00:35:47.646
We need to speak
about Mei Lin.

00:35:51.692 --> 00:35:53.401
She is dead?

00:35:53.484 --> 00:35:56.655
She was spared
for the sake of her daughter.

00:35:57.864 --> 00:35:59.615
She said you could help us.

00:35:59.700 --> 00:36:02.202
I do not know you, foreigner.
How can I trust you?

00:36:02.285 --> 00:36:04.495
I do not have the time to earn it.

00:36:04.579 --> 00:36:06.372
Your choice.

00:36:06.456 --> 00:36:10.085
Step aside, Hundred Eyes.
Let her run if she wishes.

00:36:12.128 --> 00:36:14.297
[Jing Fei breathing heavily]

00:36:21.262 --> 00:36:22.806
I come from Cambulac with news

00:36:22.889 --> 00:36:26.309
of the Great Khan's
pending assault on your city.

00:36:27.602 --> 00:36:31.106
Thousands from the barbarian horde
will descend.

00:36:32.148 --> 00:36:34.317
Song blood will flow
like the Yangtze.

00:36:34.400 --> 00:36:38.154
And you want me
to help you bring this about?

00:36:38.238 --> 00:36:41.783
I want you to help us prevent it.

00:37:04.055 --> 00:37:05.891
You must listen to me, Tulga.

00:37:05.974 --> 00:37:09.519
Our lives are in jeopardy.
The Empress Chabi asks many questions.

00:37:09.602 --> 00:37:12.397
It has become clear that
she seeks another bride for the Prince.

00:37:12.480 --> 00:37:14.149
That is fine. We run.

00:37:14.232 --> 00:37:16.609
-It is different now.
-How is it different?

00:37:16.692 --> 00:37:18.862
We can be miles away before
she notices you are gone.

00:37:18.945 --> 00:37:20.363
That is impossible.

00:37:20.446 --> 00:37:22.073
What are you saying?

00:37:22.157 --> 00:37:24.617
You must leave this place
without me.

00:37:24.700 --> 00:37:26.577
Then at least you will be safe.

00:37:26.661 --> 00:37:28.204
I will not.

00:37:28.288 --> 00:37:31.666
Someday, we shall be as one
in the Blue Sky, if not before.

00:37:31.750 --> 00:37:33.668
For now, you must leave.

00:37:33.752 --> 00:37:36.129
Do not contact me again.

00:37:52.687 --> 00:37:54.272
[gasps]

00:37:57.317 --> 00:37:58.484
Where were you?

00:38:00.570 --> 00:38:03.907
I came to you, earlier.

00:38:03.990 --> 00:38:07.660
My apologies, my Chancellor,
for not being present for you.

00:38:11.206 --> 00:38:12.748
[sighs]

00:38:12.833 --> 00:38:16.044
A gift from our brothers-in-arms
in Quinsai...

00:38:17.378 --> 00:38:19.589
for our Emperor's coronation.

00:38:26.762 --> 00:38:29.057
A peculiar substance.

00:38:31.935 --> 00:38:33.311
Where were you?

00:38:42.821 --> 00:38:44.489
At the pleasure house.

00:38:46.699 --> 00:38:48.326
I lay with no man,

00:38:48.409 --> 00:38:52.497
but... I will never lie to you.

00:38:52.580 --> 00:38:55.458
I fear for my future in this house
when you are gone.

00:38:55.541 --> 00:38:58.128
I sought assurance from the madam
that I might return to service.

00:38:58.211 --> 00:39:00.296
I will not have it.

00:39:00.380 --> 00:39:03.049
I have no choice.

00:39:06.928 --> 00:39:09.848
My meager skills demand it.

00:39:13.351 --> 00:39:14.978
Do not say that.

00:39:16.104 --> 00:39:17.647
I was mistaken.

00:39:19.357 --> 00:39:21.692
I did not know your heart
at the time.

00:39:34.747 --> 00:39:36.457
[Imperial Regent]
We carry this holy edict

00:39:36.541 --> 00:39:38.960
in name of our
benevolent Emperor

00:39:39.044 --> 00:39:41.379
on this, his coronation day.

00:39:43.006 --> 00:39:45.591
May his virtue extend to
the boundaries of heaven.

00:39:46.842 --> 00:39:50.096
<i>May his benevolence</i>
<i>sustain the world.</i>

00:40:01.024 --> 00:40:03.609
I will be here with horses
when you finish, Sifu.

00:40:04.819 --> 00:40:06.321
Godspeed.

00:40:21.752 --> 00:40:23.421
[Imperial regent] <i>To exalt virtue,</i>

00:40:23.504 --> 00:40:29.010
<i>so that all should cherish</i>
<i>the spirit of kindness and meekness,</i>

00:40:29.094 --> 00:40:33.806
<i>and that they should all enjoy</i>
<i>a reign of eternal peace.</i>

00:41:27.402 --> 00:41:29.445
"I hear and I forget.

00:41:29.529 --> 00:41:31.322
I see and I remember.

00:41:32.407 --> 00:41:34.325
I do and I understand."

00:41:35.910 --> 00:41:37.245
Do you know this proverb?

00:41:37.328 --> 00:41:38.954
All too well.

00:41:40.373 --> 00:41:42.167
Do you believe in it?

00:41:43.668 --> 00:41:47.088
I do not judge the decisions
that you have made,

00:41:47.172 --> 00:41:49.257
and I will not understand

00:41:49.340 --> 00:41:53.886
until you set
a scholar's pen to parchment.

00:41:57.390 --> 00:41:59.142
[Imperial Regent]
<i>May his righteousness guide</i>

00:41:59.225 --> 00:42:02.187
<i>the teeming multitudes of Song dynasty</i>

00:42:02.270 --> 00:42:04.064
<i>with great reverence</i>

00:42:04.147 --> 00:42:08.026
<i>and by the 16 Maxims</i>
<i>of</i> The Sacred Edict.

00:43:59.762 --> 00:44:01.431
[grunting]

00:44:41.136 --> 00:44:43.348
Who sent you, monk?

00:45:10.291 --> 00:45:12.918
You must take her with you.

00:45:13.002 --> 00:45:14.962
-Who is she?
-Mei Lin's daughter.

00:45:19.174 --> 00:45:20.260
Is it complete?

00:45:20.343 --> 00:45:21.344
[Hundred Eyes] No, it's not.

00:45:26.891 --> 00:45:27.933
Come with us.

00:45:28.017 --> 00:45:31.061
The Empress needs an ally.
I'm all that remains.

00:45:31.145 --> 00:45:33.273
Don't be scared.
He'll take you to your mother.

00:45:33.356 --> 00:45:34.857
He'll keep you safe.

00:45:34.940 --> 00:45:35.983
[Ling Ling] I'll miss you.

00:45:36.066 --> 00:45:37.985
We must ride.

00:45:39.487 --> 00:45:41.196
[Ling Ling] Jing Fei!

00:46:14.647 --> 00:46:18.067
Are you prepared to take
your throne, my Emperor?

00:46:18.150 --> 00:46:19.985
Yes.

00:47:00.776 --> 00:47:03.195
They work at pace to repair it.

00:47:03.278 --> 00:47:06.741
But as of now...
that is our way in.

00:47:20.212 --> 00:47:21.589
[Kublai] <i>The Great Genghis,</i>

00:47:22.923 --> 00:47:24.675
<i>he of the wolf,</i>

00:47:24.759 --> 00:47:27.302
<i>dreamed of a Mongol empire</i>

00:47:27.387 --> 00:47:30.014
<i>stretching throughout all of China.</i>

00:47:31.181 --> 00:47:36.396
<i>I have sought to realize his dream</i>
<i>without spilling Mongol blood.</i>

00:47:37.438 --> 00:47:39.774
<i>I have been patient.</i>

00:47:39.857 --> 00:47:41.984
<i>My patience has been rewarded...</i>

00:47:43.360 --> 00:47:47.448
<i>with the severed heads of men</i>
<i>who have marched beside you.</i>

00:47:48.365 --> 00:47:51.619
<i>My scholars, ministers</i>

00:47:51.702 --> 00:47:55.706
<i>advised me to choose</i>
<i>peace over war.</i>

00:47:56.916 --> 00:47:59.752
<i>But I am a proud Mongol.</i>

00:47:59.835 --> 00:48:01.879
<i>At times...</i>

00:48:01.962 --> 00:48:05.466
<i>peace can only be achieved</i>
<i>through cruel war.</i>

00:48:07.927 --> 00:48:10.555
<i>We begin the expedition</i>

00:48:10.638 --> 00:48:13.683
<i>to fulfill our destiny.</i>

00:48:13.766 --> 00:48:15.350
You noble men

00:48:17.019 --> 00:48:21.441
willing to die for a cause
greater than yourselves,

00:48:21.524 --> 00:48:23.067
return not with wealth,

00:48:24.276 --> 00:48:25.736
nor slaves,

00:48:26.779 --> 00:48:28.448
but with honor.

00:48:29.990 --> 00:48:32.743
Those of you
who do not return

00:48:32.827 --> 00:48:34.745
will have your names carved

00:48:34.829 --> 00:48:37.247
in the <i>Secret History</i>
<i>of the Mongols.</i>

00:48:38.499 --> 00:48:42.211
Your wives,
children and parents

00:48:42.294 --> 00:48:46.632
will hold their heads
above other Mongols,

00:48:46.716 --> 00:48:50.678
because in their hearts they know

00:48:50.761 --> 00:48:55.891
their husbands,
fathers, their sons

00:48:55.975 --> 00:49:02.147
gave their lives in pursuit of
the last dream of our Great Genghis!

00:49:03.148 --> 00:49:04.525
[all chanting] For Genghis!

00:49:04.609 --> 00:49:05.818
For Genghis!

00:49:05.901 --> 00:49:07.695
For Genghis!

00:49:07.778 --> 00:49:09.614
March!

00:49:48.110 --> 00:49:50.112
[theme music playing]